===Etymology===
[[File:A happy family in Tanzania - 20160209.png|thumb|A family ''(sense 1)'' in [[Tanzania]]]]

{{root|en|ine-pro|*dʰeh₁-}} {{dercat|en|itc-pro|ine-pro}}
From Early Modern English {{m|en|familie}} (not in Middle English), from {{der|en|la|familia||a household}}.

{{doublet|en|familia}}. Displaced native {{noncog|ang|hīred}}.

